{"v":4,"catch":"公元 1991 年。你可以聽到宇宙的心跳……","desc":"《XEXEX》是KONAMI於1991年推出的一款射擊遊戲。\n駕駛尖端戰鬥機“Flintlock”，解開 E-Square 星球上發生的一切之謎。\n在這個遊戲中，除了你平時的投籃，你還可以使用神秘的“Flint”生命體進行攻擊和防禦。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-12-23","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/831c050e94b4c8f6896173b88053dc304931128609174013e868028fd7e2bfba.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/05c6444f2c9112cd78faee8e9ef5f318e9559576036eb7871925fb2f3f88d3fb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8d513239d69633fda8a5f56da593a8814c8c4f18591d31bda7181d5899b4acd8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/897095ec321a829591acb3e84561c9f700bbedc30f70cfe997f24fbe5872991f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/865cfc953bbcb57320976900003d5c189f2ab7e5c3678a150f4e347d09f72f39.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c18074e9902eba6d6e987a6f7716cbef10bb9abede1c62dff7612fdfb99aa865.jpg"],"titleId":"01000c00165a8000","dlc":[]}